Date: Mon, 31 Aug 2026 03:20:19 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 233/307] !F (Terrain Plate) Add live terrain relief baking.

Write the plate's low-frequency relief into live terrain so terrain-dependent
systems follow the plate. Restore the captured baseline before regeneration to
prevent the plate from sampling and accumulating its own bake.
